{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-cheese-vent-toy-squishy-2609-0019b","content_id":"c7caa632-56fb-4e87-8b9d-eb81b78f5ded","description":"Product Safety Report for Cheese Vent Toy Squishy presenting a high chemical risk.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"b774859e-ad13-4b26-afa2-b8598b8ce014","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-15T16:22:17+01:00","id":"b774859e-ad13-4b26-afa2-b8598b8ce014","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-15T16:22:17+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa962a9086ce7c57b8184ff/2609-0019b-product-safety-report-cheese-vent-toy.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Cheese Vent Toy Squishy</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: There is no evidence that the product has been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures, as the supplied Declaration of Conformity did not match the product.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Sensory Toys</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Counterfeit</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Squishy shaped like a piece of cheese</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_b774859e-ad13-4b26-afa2-b8598b8ce014\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa962a9086ce7c57b8184ff/2609-0019b-product-safety-report-cheese-vent-toy.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>There is no evidence that the product has been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures, as the supplied Declaration of Conformity did not match the product. There is no valid technical documentation for the product and no evidence of production control. There is a lack of required labelling and marking. Testing identified the presence of volatile organic compounds (VOCs), including xylenes and styrene, within the product.</p>\n\n<p>In the absence of evidence demonstrating the conformity of the product, it is not possible to verify that the chemical hazards associated with these substances have been adequately assessed, or that the essential safety requirements relating to chemical properties and exposure to chemicals have been met. Certain VOCs, including xylenes, may be harmful if inhaled at sufficient concentrations.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0019b</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-15T15:22:45Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-15","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-15T16:22:45+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/cont